//  ⚠️ FIXED: Double entry issue resolved
//  logTaskMoved() now handles BOTH the taskActivity
//  AND the main activity feed logging internally.
//  The separate logActivity() call below has been REMOVED
//  to prevent duplicate entries in the dashboard feed.
